        <mxCell id="bf07-legend" value="Blue: action / document • Green: return dispatch (GI-SR) or custody release (CUS-OUT) posting • Yellow diamond: decision branch • Red: exception / alternate outcome" style="text;align=left;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#43566f;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1635" width="1360" height="28" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bf07-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Document &amp;amp; Posting Semantics (BF-07):&lt;/b&gt; Supplier return dispatch requires &lt;b&gt;both supplier agreement (UC-107) and Store Owner authorization (UC-106)&lt;/b&gt; (a matching BF-02 disposition decision may be reused without duplicate approval). At physical handover, store-owned goods deduct once via &lt;b&gt;GI-SR&lt;/b&gt;; arrival-rejected supplier goods held in custody release &lt;b&gt;CUS-OUT&lt;/b&gt; only without deducting store-owned stock. Supplier acknowledgement (&lt;b&gt;ACK&lt;/b&gt;) and case closure (&lt;b&gt;UC-83&lt;/b&gt;) never deduct stock a second time. Replacements require a new linked &lt;b&gt;BF-01 arrival / GR-P&lt;/b&gt;; compensation money or agreement never recreates stock." style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f3f5f8;strokeColor=#d6dde6;align=left;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fontColor=#34465e;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1670" width="1360" height="150" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
